00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:33.000
Tirzah's iPhone (2): Yeah, those are, yeah, real stats. So I think those are good.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:38.000
Alina: Okay. That surprises me, a state… well, I guess a state kind of is…

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:45.000
Alina: I don't know, I'm really learning, no offense, Carmen, but the younger generation and their vocabulary is very limited.

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:52.000
Alina: So, because I was like, a state wedding, I would think that would be popular, but it's not. Nobody says a state anymore.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:12:11.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, and that's the thing, I was trying to go for the unique keywords and see if there's anything that's untapped. Uh, that's why you can see here, like, the competition's kind of medium on that one. Uh, I was looking again for other things, like equestrian or, I don't know, old money, I know you guys are not marketing old money, but just kind of seeing a range of things, and really, those had zero searches, so…

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.000
Alina: And.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:15.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, these ones really hit it. Okay, well, good.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.000
