00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:14.000
Carmen Cruickshank: No, that's okay. Yeah, we can take out affordable, yeah. Uh, I put, like, a few…

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:27.000
Tirzah's iPhone (2): I would leave affordable, not cheap, not free, obviously, but I mean, they're kind of a mid-range price, so I think affordable is, uh, means different things to different people, so I think that one's fine.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.000
Alina: Great.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:33.000
