00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:35.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm, that is true.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:36.000
Tirzah's iPhone (2): I think it is affordable.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.000
Alina: Okay.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:51.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay, good to know. Uh, yeah, I had other random ones in there, like plan, plans, uh, degree, how-to, but is there any, like, competitors or anything, like, specific you guys know? I don't want our ad showing up for people searching that.

