Alina: So when does, well, my only question is when does the cold phase start?

00:25:21.000 --> 00:25:22.000
Tirzah's iPhone (2): Yeah.

00:25:21.000 --> 00:25:36.000
Whitney Hodges: So our team is working right now on these ads, the copy and the creatives for these ads. So as soon as those are ready, we'll be sending them over to you for your review and stamp of approval and then getting them launched from there.

00:25:36.000 --> 00:25:42.000
Alina: Okay, but what does that mean? Does that mean a day, a week, or what are we looking at?

00:25:37.000 --> 00:25:40.000
Tirzah's iPhone (2): All right, that was my question. So we…

