Whitney Hodges: Yeah, let me take a look really quick.

00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:48.000
Whitney Hodges: Just to make sure I get the date right for you.

00:25:49.000 --> 00:26:02.000
Tirzah's iPhone (2): And my question was, um, do you have the content that you need? Kinsey's doing social media, so, like, if there is a trend that you see, like, this is a great video that works really well, like, she did a…

