Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:26:01.000 --> 00:26:03.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:26:02.000 --> 00:26:17.000
Tirzah's iPhone (2): It was a very, very short video that she posted today, but if there's ever something like that that you feel like would be helpful, like, on, um, not just static pictures, but, like, a little video, just know that we have someone that could do that very quickly.

