Whitney Hodges: Right.

00:26:17.000 --> 00:26:19.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, perfect.

00:26:17.000 --> 00:26:27.000
Tirzah's iPhone (2): Even now, like, if there's something you want her to make as you're creating those ads, like, if you have an example of one that's worked really well, we can, like, recreate it.

00:26:21.000 --> 00:26:23.000
