Tirzah's iPhone (2): Any of that.

00:26:28.000 --> 00:26:41.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, perfect. Yeah, love it. Yeah, so if we identify something that we need, then we'll definitely send it, um, it over to you guys so that you can, um, share that with Kenzie. Just want to find the…

00:26:42.000 --> 00:26:46.000
Whitney Hodges: Timeline for your onboarding really quickly…

00:26:48.000 --> 00:26:51.000
Alina: Pierce, are you calling me about her at some point?

00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:59.000
Tirzah's iPhone (2): Yes, I was supposed to call you about it yesterday, and my day was a cluster, so I just couldn't. Um, but as soon as we're done today.

