Whitney Hodges: Okay, so I am seeing that this morning, a creative brief went over to our designer for the client attraction campaigns. It usually takes her, you know.

00:27:28.000 --> 00:27:44.000
Whitney Hodges: 48 to 72 hours to get something fully pulled together. So, you know, I'm hoping by the end of this week, early next week, that those initial campaigns would be over to you for your review. Um, and then, you know, if we get your stamp of approval right away, they can go live.

00:27:44.000 --> 00:27:50.000
Whitney Hodges: very quickly thereafter, or if you'd like to see edits, we're happy to help with those.

